{"unit_id":"jjoni12__dsh-locale-ko#feature-1","repo":"jjoni12/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"2ec529998cab08aa7e6f5581c907fff0cad770c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 的功能「韩语语言注册」：通过 DSH 的 locale 服务添加名为 ko、标签为 한국어 的语言，并以英语作为回退语言。插件注册每个命名空间的韩语字典，语言偏好由 DSH 管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2874-2884"]}
