{"unit_id":"jjoni12__dsh-locale-ko#feature-3","repo":"jjoni12/dsh-locale-ko","commit":"2ec529998cab08aa7e6f5581c907fff0cad770c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ko 的功能「切换语言后恢复原文」：插件记录被替换的文本与属性；离开韩语时断开 DOM 观察器，并仅在节点仍保留插件译文时恢复原始内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:49-56","src/client.template.js:88-118","lib/client.js:2885-2891"]}
